and materials, $N?',0),(8701,0,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the ring and materials, $N?',0),(8702,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the ring and materials, $N?',0),(8703,0,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the ring and materials, $N?',0),(8704,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the ring and materials, $N?',0),(8705,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the components I require, $N?',0),(8706,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the components I require, $N?',0),(8707,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the components I require, $N?',0),(8708,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the components I require, Bueno?',0),(8709,0,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the components I require, $N?',0),(8710,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the components I require, $N?',0),(8711,0,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the components I require, $N?',0),(8712,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the components I require, $N?',0),(8728,1,0,0,0,'Arcanite buoys don\'t just make themselves, $N. And NO, you cannot borrow some money.',0),(8729,1,0,0,0,'Time is running out, champion.',0),(8730,1,0,0,0,'Another of our heroes lost to the spawn of Deathwing. We will be cursed with this suffering forever...',0),(8731,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve completed your field duty, $N?  Captain Skullsplit can be found outside of Hive\'Regal.',0),(8732,1,0,0,0,'I take it you want those papers signed, $Gboy:girl;?',0),(8735,1,0,0,0,'<Remulos is lost deep in thought.>',0),(8737,1,0,0,0,'Is your task done yet, $N?',0),(8738,1,0,0,0,'You\'ll find Scout Landion inside Hive\'regal. Hurry, $N! Time is of the essence.',0),(8739,1,0,0,0,'You\'ll find Scout Jalia inside Hive\'Ashi.  Hurry, $N!  Time is of the essence.',0),(8740,1,0,0,0,'Is your task done yet, $N?',0),(8742,0,0,0,0,'A thousand years has passed and just as it was fated, one stands before me. One who shall lead their people to a new age.$B$BThe Old God trembles, $N. Oh yes, it fears your faith. Shatter the prophecy of C\'Thun.$B$BIt knows you come, champion - and with you comes the might of Kalimdor. You have only to let me know when you are prepared and I shall grant you the Scepter of the Shifting Sands.',0),(8743,1,0,0,0,'The Scarab Gong looms ominously before you. Steel yourself, $N; for once the Scarab Gong is rung, the gates of Ahn\'Qiraj will be opened.$B$BFrom the slackened maw of the beast can only come chaos and destruction. Defend your people!',0),(8746,20,20,0,0,'$N!  Did you find him?  Were the notes in the satchel I gave you enough information to locate Metzen?  I hate to think of that those cruel thugs might do to him... but there\'s no way we can afford to pay such an exorbitant ransom!',0),(8748,1,0,0,0,'Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.',0),(8749,1,0,0,0,'You honor my kind, $N. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.$b$bYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.',0),(8750,1,0,0,0,'Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, $N. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.$b$bHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.',0),(8751,1,0,0,0,'Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!$b$bHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.',0),(8753,1,0,0,0,'Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.',0),(8754,1,0,0,0,'You honor my kind, $N. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.$b$bYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.',0),(8755,1,0,0,0,'Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, $N. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.$b$bHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.',0),(8756,1,0,0,0,'Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!$b$bHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.',0),(8758,1,0,0,0,'Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.',0),(8759,1,0,0,0,'You honor my kind, $N. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.$b$bYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.',0),(8760,1,0,0,0,'Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, $N. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.$b$bHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.',0),(8761,1,0,0,0,'Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!$b$bHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.',0),(8762,20,20,0,0,'$N!  Were the notes in the satchel I gave you enough information to locate Metzen?  I hate to think of that those cruel thugs might do to him... but there\'s no way we can afford to pay such an exorbitant ransom!',0),(8763,1,0,0,0,'The \"Holly Preserver\" machine looks like some sort of still at first, but a careful examination of it reveals some goblin-esque changes to it. Still, your skill at cooking seems to allow you to understand how the machine works. $B$BThere is already fresh holly in the machine - you simply need to provide some deeprock salt and five gold coins to get the machine working.',0),(8764,1,0,0,0,'Champion, should you decide to walk another path, present me with your signet ring and a mountain of scarabs from our enemies in Ahn\'Qiraj.',0),(8765,1,0,0,0,'Champion, should you decide to walk another path,