quire direction?',0),(9137,1,1,0,0,'For every bundle of fronds that you deliver to me, I will pay you with your choice of an insignia of the Dawn or the Crusade.$B$BInsignias may be turned in to the Quartermaster for various rewards.',0),(9141,6,6,0,0,'<Commander Metz chews on his cigar.>$B$BWhat is it? I\'m a busy man.',0),(9142,1,1,0,0,'You know the drill, kid. One valor token gets you a craftsman\'s writ.',0),(9153,1,1,0,0,'It will take time to prevail against this threat. How have you fared, $n?',0),(9154,6,6,0,0,'You\'ve come to join our order, have you not?',0),(9165,25,25,0,0,'Name, rank and serial number!',0),(9178,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9179,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9181,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9182,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9183,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9184,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9185,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9186,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9187,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9188,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9190,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9191,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9194,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9195,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9196,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9197,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9198,6,6,0,0,'Filling a work order, $c?',0),(9200,6,6,0,0,'Filling a work order, $c?',0),(9201,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9202,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9203,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9204,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9205,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C? ',0),(9206,1,0,0,0,'Filling a work order, $C?',0),(9208,1,0,0,0,'Do you have the arcanum?',0),(9209,1,0,0,0,'Do you have the arcanum?',0),(9210,1,0,0,0,'Do you have the arcanum?',0),(9211,1,1,0,0,'If it were not for these Argent Dawn guards, you would be a stain upon this floor.\n',0),(9213,274,274,0,0,'<Mataus yawns.>$B$BBe gone, insect, lest you have something for me.',0),(9221,1,0,0,0,'Choose carefully. There are no refunds.',0),(9222,1,0,0,0,'Choose carefully. There are no refunds.',0),(9223,1,1,0,0,'Choose carefully. There are no refunds.',0),(9224,0,0,0,0,'Choose carefully. There are no refunds.',0),(9225,1,0,0,0,'Choose carefully. There are no refunds.',0),(9226,1,0,0,0,'Choose carefully. There are no refunds.',0),(9227,1,0,0,0,'Choose carefully. There are no refunds.',0),(9228,1,0,0,0,'Choose carefully. There are no refunds.',0),(9229,6,6,0,0,'Any news of Ramaladni?',0),(9230,1,1,0,0,'Frozen runes could probably be found inside Naxxramas.',0),(9232,6,6,0,0,'You haven\'t run into Omarion, have you?',0),(9233,1,0,0,0,'Is that what I think it is?$B$B<Wilhelm appears to be drooling.>',0),(9234,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9235,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9236,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9237,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9239,6,6,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9240,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9241,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9242,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9243,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9244,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9245,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9246,1,0,0,0,'Have you brought the materials?',0),(9248,6,6,0,0,'Fandu-dath-belore? Oh, pardon me, $N. I did not recognize you. Have you the scepter?\n',0),(9250,1,0,0,0,'It was her time, mortal.',0),(9251,1,0,0,0,'In its current form, the staff is far too dangerous to be in the hands of a mortal.',0),(9257,1,0,0,0,'I must not interfere, $R.',0),(9259,1,0,0,0,'That mangy dog, Revilgaz, has offered to pardon any former Bloodsails willing to turn on their cap\'n!  That bilge sucker asked me to go an\' off me ole\' mates and to bring back their bandannas as proof.$b$bI don\'t have it in me heart to do that, nor will I ask ye to.  Bring me some silk cloth and red dye and I\'ll make suitable replicas.  I\'ll tell the Baron you went turncoat, but be warned... the Bloodsails are not gonna like it!',0),(9260,0,0,0,0,'Have you investigated the invasion yet? There\'s no time for dawdling!',0),(9261,0,0,0,0,'Have you investigated the invasion yet? There\'s no time for dawdling!',0),(9262,0,0,0,0,'Have you investigated the invasion yet? There\'s no time for dawdling!',0),(9263,0,0,0,0,'Have you investigated the invasion yet? There\'s no time for dawdling!',0),(9264,0,0,0,0,'Have you investigated the invasion yet? There\'s no time for dawdling!',0),(9265,0,0,0,0,'Have you investigated the invasion yet? There\'s no time for dawdling!',0),(9266,1,1,0,0,'You must\'ve done something really bad to us or our friends, $N. At any rate, I\'m here to offer you a way to get our good graces back.$b$bAs you know, Winterspring is quite cold. With so many of us goblins coming from other cities, we could use a hand keeping warm. Bring me some runecloth and coal and I\'ll put in the good word for ya. Be warned though, our enemies are not going to take kindly to your helping us.',0),(9267,1,0,0,0,'You\'d better think twice before setting foot in Ratchet, $n! Word\'s been getting around of your dirty deeds.$b$bYou\'re in luck though, a ship just arrived with many wounded from an encounter with the Bloodsail Buccaneers. This is your chance to prove you\'re not a complete scoundrel. Lend us a hand by bringing linen cloth for bandages and empty vials for potions.',0),(9268,1,0,0,0,'You seek to befriend the goblins of Tanaris once again, $N? We\'re in need of materials for sails and guns to fight off our old enemies, the Bloodsail Buccaneers. Bring me mageweave and strong flux and we\'ll be on our way to pardoning your trespasses.',0),(9269,1,0,0,0,'I must not interfere, $R.',0),(9270,1,0,0,0,'I must not interfere, $R.',0),(9271,1,0,0,0,'I must not interfere, $R.',0),(9292,6,6,0,0,'Is there something you need?',0),(9295,0,0,0,0,'Yes? What do you have there?',0),(9299,0,0,0,0,'Yes? What do you have there?',0),(9300,0,0,0,0,'Yes? What do you have there?',0),(9301,0,0,0,0,'Yes? What do you have there?',0),(9302,0,0,0,0,'Yes? What do you have there?',0),(9304,0,0,0,0,'Yes? What do you have there?',0),(9310,0,0,0,0,'Can I help you with something?',0),(9317,1,1,0,0,'If you bring me eight necrotic runes from the Scourge invaders, I can give you a consecrated sharpening stone. It should be of great help in your battle against the minions of the Lich King.',0),(9318,1,1,0,0,'In exchange for the necrotic runes of the Scourge invaders, the Argent Dawn will give you one vial of blessed wizard oil.',0),(9319,0,0,0,0,'Have you found your way through the dark?',0),(9320,1,1,0,0,'In addition to our other supplies, we also have a number of major mana potions you may find useful. I will give you one in exchange for fifteen necrotic runes.',0),(9321,1,1,0,0,'In addition to our other supplies, we also have a number of major healing potions you may find useful. I will give you one in exchange for fifteen necrotic runes.',0),(9322,0,0,0,0,'Are the flames of Kalimdor burning brightly?',0),(9323,0,0,0,0,'Have you yet traveled the continent? Enlightenment awaits you.',0),(9324,1,0,0,0,'You\'re practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?',0),(9325,1,0,0,0,'You\'re practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?',0),(9326,1,0,0,0,'You\'re practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?',0),(9330,1,0,0,0,'You\'re practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?',0),(9331,1,0,0,0,'You\'re practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?',0),(9332,1,0,0,0,'You\'re practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?',0),(9333,1,1,0,0,'If you bring me thirty necrotic runes, I will give you your choice of hand protection in return. These should prove valuable in our fight against the undead Scourge.',0),(9334,1,1,0,0,'In exchange for the necrotic runes of the Scourge invaders, the Argent Dawn will give you one vial of blessed wizard oil.',0),(9335,1,1,0,0,'If you bring me eight necrotic runes from the Scourge invaders, I can give you a consecrated sharpening stone. It should be of great help in your battle against the minions of the Lich King.',0),(9336,1,1,0,0,'In addition to our other supplies, we also have a number of major healing potions you may find useful. I will give you one in exchange for fifteen necrotic runes.',0),(9337,1,1,0,0,'In addition to our other supplies, we also have a number of major mana potions you may find useful. I will give you one in exchange for fifteen necrotic runes.',0),(9338,0,0,0,0,'Even if you have no need for the material rewards we offer, these badges still mark our mutual trust and friendship.$B$BBring them to me.  I\'ll make due note of your service should your performance go above and beyond the call of duty.',0),(9341,1,1,0,0,'You have aided our cause greatly, $n. If you wish, I can make available the tabard of the Argent Dawn. We are proud to have you among our allies.',0),(9343,1,1,0,0,'You have aided our cause greatly, $n. If you wish, I can make available the tabard of the Argent Dawn. We are proud to have you among our allies.',0),(9362,1,0,0,0,'There is not time to waste! Have you the shell?',0),(9364,1,0,0,0,'Have you collected the magic?',0),(9367,0,0,0,0,'Are the fires burning?',0),(9368,1,0,0,0,'Have you had any luck, $N?',0),(9386,1,0,0,0,'Have you found your way through the dark?',0),(9388,0,0,0,0,'The fires cannot die until the festival is done!',0),(9389,0,0,0,0,'Have you seen to your task?',0),(9419,0,0,0,0,'Be careful out there, but also be quick. We have no time to lose.',0),(9422,0,0,0,0,'Be wary of the dangers of the desert, $n. With the Alliance lurking in the dunes, any step could be your last.',0),(9664,1,1,0,0,'When the towers are under our control, we will soon be able to surround the Forsaken. After that, it is only a matter of time before we can crush them.',0),(9665,1,1,0,0,'They must be fools to think that we would allow them to establish bases so close to one of our capitals.$b$bWe will bleed their numbers until they turn tail and retreat back to the south.',0),(79097,0,0,0,0,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',70124),(86784,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to my fire, traveler.',70124),(91741,0,0,0,0,'What\'s that you got there? It looks like one of my books.',70124),(91743,0,0,0,0,'Have you rescued my books yet, $n?!',70124),(91752,0,0,0,0,'Have you retrieved those stolen books yet?',70124),(91772,0,0,0,0,'Have you figured out where the Kobolds are heading?',70124),(92421,0,0,0,0,'What remains of the invading scourge? Have you managed to find suitable replacement parts?',70124),(92461,0,0,0,0,'As unsavory as it is to need to cull living creatures, this type of guiding hand is needed to avert disaster in our homeland. This is an important lesson for one such as yourself to learn.',70124),(92462,0,0,0,0,'Such pests cannot be allowed to find root in our peaceful grove. An infestation can quickly grow dangerous if left unchecked.',70124),(92465,0,0,0,0,'Is it done?',70124),(92468,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, ye\'ve returned. If ye have the stone, it means the mountain\'s chosen ye true. I\'ll give ye the totem it promised. But if ye\'ve come empty-handed, off with ye! The path ain\'t for those who forget their way.',70124),(92470,0,0,0,0,'What I ask of you is not easy, but you must be prepared for much greater challenges if you are to survive long enough to be of service to Zephras Isle.',70124),(92473,0,0,0,0,'The ursera have grown far more aggressive of late. I wonder what has changed to cause this shift in behavior?',70124),(92479,0,0,0,0,'Ah, ye got me letter, $n... good.$B$BTime was when ye\'d not catch a human dead wit\' a bow in their hand--no more, I guess. It\'s good for Stormwind, but bad for the kobolds and man eatin\' beasts in the area.',70124),(92482,0,0,0,0,'<Tai\'ree nods at you curtly.>',70124),(92485,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, I am Xyton Silverwind, keeper of druidic lore.',70124),(92515,0,0,0,0,'If you ask me, I think Prideclaws are actually kind of cute. From a safe distance... and while standing behind someone holding a sword, of course.',70124),(92550,0,0,0,0,'It feels good to turn the tables on these zealots.',70124),(92551,0,0,0,0,'There\'s a lot of hungry and desperate skyborne here who need these supplies.',70124),(92553,0,0,0,0,'No matter how much things change here on Zephras and how uncertain things get, I always say that a pipe full of dried peacebloom and nice full belly is a comfort that can\'t be beat!',70124),(92579,0,0,0,0,'A letter from Aonda. What\'s that crafty highlander been up to?',70124),(92644,0,0,0,0,'You are back? And... alone?',70124),(92679,0,0,0,0,'What? Alvarion is alive?',70124),(92682,0,0,0,0,'These bandits are more likely to double cross and steal from each other than they are to steal from normal folks. I bet if Ferauu knew some of his people went rogue and came here early to tamper with the harvest, he\'d kill them himself.',70124),(92683,0,0,0,0,'Flutterflies are normally docile and calm, but rub them the wrong way and sometimes they\'ll surprise you.',70124),(92684,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t think I\'ve had real meat for dinner in... well, too long.',70124),(92685,0,0,0,0,'If you manage to bring me enough bandit masks, maybe I\'ll stitch a blanket out of them and give it to Ferauu.\r\n\r\n<Aamelia laughs loudly.>',70124),(92693,0,0,0,0,'There\'s not enough stormapples in skywall to repay you for this.',70124),(92727,0,0,0,0,'Those shrieklings are too dangerous to be left to nest this close to Valanaar. However... they are the least of our troubles.',70124),(92741,0,0,0,0,'The High Order do not make it a habit to employ themselves as simple trappers and game wardens, but when performing a service such as this can lead to scholarly gain, we are happy to engage in acts of community service.',70124),(92834,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t agree with the Windshapers often, but they were right to dismiss the idea of trying to engage peacefully with the Al\'Aketh. My attempt to take the high road cost a dear friend his life and is a mistake I will have to live with for the rest of my days.',70124),(92840,0,0,0,0,'It\'s often difficult for me to establish a distinction between the Windshapers and the Al\'Aketh, save that one is more overtly violent than the other. Equally slavish to their misplaced beliefs, they are both equally dangerous if left to their own devices.\r\n\r\nThey see our desire to better understand this realm and its magic as a desecration of their traditions. Their small-mindedness is why our mission is so important. If not us, who will have the courage to save Zephras?',70124),(93160,0,0,0,0,'Mmm, I think you are going to like what I can cook up with these acorns!',70124),(93165,0,0,0,0,'I will not rest until my fangs have gone through the throat of every single cultist on this isle.',70124),(93317,0,0,0,0,'Windsong Crawler meat is common enough here but it was something of a delicacy on the islands of Anvilas and Siroccas. Was a time, back when the skystreams were open that the locals would mob me for the stuff when I\'d make the trip to Shen\'dramar or New Eldre\'naar.\r\n\r\nNot been able to visit those places in... well... a long time.',70124),(93318,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll need the creature\'s head as proof of the deed.',70124),(93319,0,0,0,0,'These sneakthieves have likely been breaking into our supplies for months. I tried to convince Aonda to put a raid together to clear out that bandit cave for good, but she didn\'t want to pull the few peacekeepers we have away from the village. \r\n\r\nWith the cultists at Falaath Village to the south growing in numbers, I suppose I can\'t fault her for that.',70124),(93459,0,0,0,0,'<Vayn nods at you.>',70124),(93552,0,0,0,0,'Hello there, $c.',70124),(93736,0,0,0,0,'Shadowgale Forest is a dangerous place. Some even say it\'s haunted. I\'m quite sure that I don\'t believe that, but I do know that it\'s not for the faint hearted, or the unprepared.',70124),(93737,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t imagine why anyone would want to steal these components from this construct. Other than the gyrozephyr these components have almost no practical application. Even the gyro would be nigh-useless outside of its intended purpose.',70124),(93740,0,0,0,0,'The Al\'Aketh have engaged in their bloody zealotry for far too long. This is only the start of the reckoning they face.',70124),(93927,0,0,0,0,'What news from the western watch?',70124),(93948,0,0,0,0,'What is that you have for me? Oh... oh no.',70124),(93951,0,0,0,0,'What beautiful things did you bring me?',70124),(94414,0,0,0,0,'My gift is simple, and mundane. I cannot peer between worlds such as those with the skysight, nor can I draw upon the magic of the ley lines beneath Zephras like others can. But a gift it remains and I am grateful to have it.\r\n\r\nAppreciation of what you have is the key to happiness. Yearning for what you may have, or what you have lost, only leads to despair.',70124),(94485,0,0,0,0,'Have you found the Lady\'s Tear?',70124),(94486,0,0,0,0,'It deeply saddens me to ask you to kill the young shrieklings, but with the rise in their aggression it is for the best. We can only handle so many emergencies at a time.',70124),(94487,0,0,0,0,'I will make the cult pay for every drop of druid blood they have spilled this day.',70124),(94488,0,0,0,0,'Are our brethren\'s lives truly worth so little to you, Haalien?',70124),(94864,0,0,0,0,'You will learn, $n, and one day you will be a great hunter.',70124),(94896,0,0,0,0,'So many of us left with nothing more than the clothes on our backs. Any belongings you might recover would be cherished.',70124),(94897,0,0,0,0,'Have you any news of Resaan? Please, $c, the wait is hard to endure after everything that has happened.',70124),(95204,0,0,0,0,'What have you got there, $c? A tasty morsel?',70124),(95314,0,0,0,0,'I trust you did not get lost?',70124),(95998,0,0,0,0,'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors is critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.',70124),(96403,0,0,0,0,'<Thom appears to absentmindedly rub his hands together as he looks at you.>',70124),(96627,0,0,0,0,'Are you here to learn about camping in the wilderness?',70124),(97242,0,0,0,0,'We discover formulations and recipes by showing old ingredients to new generations, who experiment with them in their own way.',70124),(97249,0,0,0,0,'I think we can win this one...',70124),(97277,0,0,0,0,'Poor Goz is more concerned for his mecha-walker than himself. Says if anyone gets a hold of that mechanic\'s log he\'s greased. Hah! That\'s why I told him he should just leave his work at home!',70124),(97291,0,0,0,0,'For Othmar\'s crimes against the Dark Lady, placing him under that oozing specimen is the least he deserves.\r\n\r\nAnd it\'s funny...',70124),(97326,0,0,0,0,'It\'s nice to not have to always sit in the dirt!',70124),(97485,0,0,0,0,'There are many occasions one may choose to spread incense to the winds. You could be asking the Earthmother to watch over someone, bless a hunt, celebrate an occasion, or even to seek guidance from our ancestors.\r\n\r\nOr it could be something else entirely.\r\n\r\nThough the act is done with reverence, it is not strictly a ceremonial affair. Typically there are certain traditional steps observed when performing this act, but many tribes have differing practices.',70124),(97558,0,0,0,0,'Have you gathered the skin I inquired about? Our stocks are running low.\r\n\r\nIt may seem odd to ask for murloc skin but it works well for internal membranes, or surfaces like cheeks or mouths.\r\n\r\nSimilarly, the duskbat wing membranes are especially suited for more delicate areas, like faces or fingers. It prevents the skin from being too... thick.',70124),(97968,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I can teach you.',70124),(97969,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I can teach you.',70124),(97971,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $c. I can teach you.',70124),(98423,0,0,0,0,'What have you brought from the depths, $c.',70124),(98581,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you were able to read the rune? It is imbued with the power of elements from some of our oldest script. That shows that you have the makings of a shaman.',70124),(98601,0,0,0,0,'Through pain comes resolve.',70124),(99127,0,0,0,0,'Any catches to speak of?',70124),(99141,0,0,0,0,'You\'d best have those reports in hand, or get out of my face.',70124),(99196,0,0,0,0,'We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth.  A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Orgrimmar for your generous actions.  Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I\'m able to take them from you now.',70124);
